{"id": "EUVD-2026-67820", "enisaUuid": "525a0725-e4a8-35da-9ef7-ac97bfd74870", "description": "Gitingest through 0.3.1 fails to properly validate hostnames in _validate_host, accepting any host with a git., gitlab., or github. prefix regardless of known-hosts list membership. Attackers can submit URLs with attacker-controlled hostnames to trigger outbound connections to arbitrary hosts and disclose GitHub personal access tokens via HTTP basic credentials.", "datePublished": "2026-08-28T16:19:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:20:19", "baseScore": 8.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:H/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/coderamp-labs/gitingest/issues/592", "https://github.com/coderamp-labs/gitingest", "https://github.com/coderamp-labs/gitingest/blob/4e259a02fe72115bee538271622f1234a81c8e1a/src/gitingest/utils/query_parser_utils.py", "https://github.com/coderamp-labs/gitingest/blob/4e259a02fe72115bee538271622f1234a81c8e1a/src/gitingest/utils/git_utils.py", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitingest-prefix-based-git-host-check-enables-request-forgery-and-token-disclosure"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mvv9-5ggf-37rj", "CVE-2026-82289"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.31, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "407eabd4-d350-303d-b5c3-1411bcfaac19", "product": {"name": "gitingest", "vendor": {"name": "coderamp-labs"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.3.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fa70ce51-c016-3083-aa8f-6556a1b35aed", "vendor": {"name": "coderamp-labs"}}], "isExploited": false}